### Summary

Part 1 (index.ts, +5 −0) adds a sync-state refresh, an availability probe and a `workspace` field to the relocate handler. The `workspace` field fixes a missing required field on the success result. But the refresh runs after the gate has committed, unlike the addWorkspace and createWorkspace siblings that refresh before the switch. That leaves a short window where a capture on an xattr-only Drive folder could be placed by hard link. Open threads don't touch this file, so there are no thread replies.

